{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-01/1063949/block/singleImage/3268062/df/01KEVSYA7CS9BBGK44MWRFDHTN.jpg?updatedAt=1794796498\"/><figcaption>明愛醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>石硤尾邨發生燒炭企圖自殺案。 今日（16日）早上7時28分，深水埗石硤尾邨第23座響起火警鐘聲，其中一個單位傳來疑似燒炭氣味，一名男街坊見狀於是拍門惟無人回應，懷疑一名女子燒炭輕生，於是報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，發現一名29歲女子戴上口罩，清醒由救護車送往明愛醫院治理；另外一名26歲男子吸入濃煙不適，在救護車內接受檢查。警方將案件暫列「企圖自殺」，正在調查事件。據悉，女事主有精神病記錄。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:31:46.257577+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:34:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:32.783162+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T03:24:57.778437+00:00","content_hash":"1bf8b97e04cf99b26d048fe5ccc4ee0cf0d1839357f4351e073d8d43a8e8f5d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:31:46.257577+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}